#: ../../source/docs/sitl-parameters.rst:5 b4294961314a4b38b84cc3226a133c39
msgid "SITL Parameters"
msgstr "SITL 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-parameters.rst:8 05b23704822b4ecfa95028b3903aca2b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot SITL has many parameters with which one can simulate sensor "
"failures, wind or wave influence, sensor imperfections, etc."
msgstr "ArduPilot SITL 有许多参数，可用于仿真传感器故障、风力或波浪影响、传感器缺陷等。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-parameters.rst:10 8a8f6b31aabb4995abf6c35f3e96bb14
msgid ""
"All SITL parameters are listed in each vehicle's "
":ref:`Parameters<plane:parameters_sim>` page under \"Simulation "
"Parameters\"."
msgstr "所有 SITL 参数均在各飞行器的 :ref:`参数 <plane:parameters_sim>` 页面的「仿真参数」部分列出。"
